cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NeuroFoil — ML-Accelerated Aerodynamic Design and CFD Verification Platform"
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BLACKNIGHT-cloud12"
    website: "https://github.com/BLACKNIGHT-cloud12"
repository-code: "https://github.com/BLACKNIGHT-cloud12/NeuroFoil-Core"
abstract: "NeuroFoil is an open engineering platform coupling an automated 2D RANS
  OpenFOAM pipeline (simpleFoam, k-omega SST, structured C-grids, y+ ~ 1) with neural
  surrogate models for force coefficients and surface pressure distributions, deployed
  through a pure-NumPy runtime. It provides split-conformal 95% uncertainty intervals,
  Mahalanobis out-of-distribution guardrails, aero-structural wingbox mechanics, and
  constrained multidisciplinary design optimization (MDAO) with one-click CFD
  verification."
keywords:
  - aerodynamics
  - CFD
  - surrogate modeling
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - OpenFOAM
  - machine learning
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
